{
  "id": "universal-edge-cancel",
  "name": "Edge cancel",
  "part": "tech",
  "characters": "all",
  "goal": "Slide off the edge during an aerial's landing lag",
  "why": "An aerial landed near the edge with speed toward it slides {char} off the stage before the landing lag ends. The rest of the landing lag is gone and {char} is in the air, free to act, where the opponent expects {char} to be stuck in lag.",
  "tutorial": {
    "camera": {
      "follow": "player",
      "distance": 120,
      "height": 10
    },
    "what": "An edge cancel is an aerial's landing that slides {char} off the edge of the stage before the landing lag ends.",
    "expect": "Each jump is judged when the landing lag ends or is cut short: whether {char} landed during the aerial, reached the edge, stopped there or slid off.",
    "example": [
      {
        "press": "jump",
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": 1
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          1,
          0
        ],
        "frame": 1,
        "hold": "SA-1"
      },
      {
        "press": "A",
        "frame": "SA"
      },
      {
        "stick": [
          1,
          0
        ],
        "frame": "SA+1",
        "hold": 60
      }
    ],
    "marks": {
      "1": "Frame 1: jump pressed and released, stick held toward the edge: drift",
      "SA": "Frame {SA}: the aerial",
      "NL": "Frame {NL}: landed during the aerial, sliding toward the edge"
    },
    "lessons": [
      {
        "title": "Landing lag slides",
        "text": [
          "{char} keeps the speed it had in the air when it lands, and slides with it through the landing lag. Landing lag stops {char} from acting, not from moving: friction slows the slide a little each frame.",
          "Drift toward the edge through the jump and land close to it: the slide then reaches the edge before the landing lag is over."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  1,
                  0
                ],
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": "SA-1"
              },
              {
                "press": "A",
                "frame": "SA"
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  1,
                  0
                ],
                "frame": "SA+1",
                "hold": 60
              }
            ],
            "inputs_for": {
              "mr-game-and-watch": [
                {
                  "press": "jump",
                  "frame": 1,
                  "hold": 1
                },
                {
                  "stick": [
                    1,
                    0
                  ],
                  "frame": 1,
                  "hold": 100
                },
                {
                  "cstick": [
                    0,
                    -1
                  ],
                  "frame": "SA"
                }
              ]
            },
            "marks": {
              "1": "Frame 1: jump pressed and released, stick held toward the edge: drift",
              "SA": "Frame {SA}: the aerial",
              "NL": "Frame {NL}: landed during the aerial, sliding toward the edge"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  1,
                  "NL-1"
                ],
                "words": "Drift toward the edge",
                "kind": "go"
              },
              {
                "frames": [
                  "NL",
                  "NL+2"
                ],
                "words": "Landing lag: sliding",
                "kind": "info"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "At the edge",
        "text": [
          "When the slide reaches the edge, the game reads which way {char} faces and the control stick. Facing the edge, with the stick short of 0.75 toward it, {char} stops at the edge and teeters. Facing away from the edge, or with the stick past 0.75 toward it, {char} slides off and falls.",
          "Either way the landing lag ends there. Keep the stick held toward the edge through the landing, and {char} slides off."
        ],
        "show": {
          "example": {
            "inputs": [
              {
                "press": "jump",
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": 1
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  1,
                  0
                ],
                "frame": 1,
                "hold": "SA-1"
              },
              {
                "press": "A",
                "frame": "SA"
              },
              {
                "stick": [
                  1,
                  0
                ],
                "frame": "SA+1",
                "hold": 60
              }
            ],
            "inputs_for": {
              "mr-game-and-watch": [
                {
                  "press": "jump",
                  "frame": 1,
                  "hold": 1
                },
                {
                  "stick": [
                    1,
                    0
                  ],
                  "frame": 1,
                  "hold": 100
                },
                {
                  "cstick": [
                    0,
                    -1
                  ],
                  "frame": "SA"
                }
              ]
            },
            "marks": {
              "SA": "Frame {SA}: the aerial",
              "NL": "Frame {NL}: landed, stick still held toward the edge"
            },
            "cues": [
              {
                "frames": [
                  "NL",
                  "NL+3"
                ],
                "words": "Hold toward the edge",
                "kind": "go"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "example_for": {
      "mr-game-and-watch": [
        {
          "press": "jump",
          "frame": 1,
          "hold": 1
        },
        {
          "stick": [
            1,
            0
